# Safety

- Never run destructive commands without approval.
- Never delete files without approval.
- Never reset databases without approval.
- Never replace major libraries without approval.
- Treat data loss risk (wipe, migrate-destroy, force push, recursive delete) as requiring explicit user OK.
- When unsure whether an action is destructive, ask first.
